,66,91,16],[26013,41.3,1964,70,87,21]],"links":[["Lycoming County in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/pennsylvania/lycoming-county"],["ARC or PLC in Lycoming County","/arc-plc/pennsylvania/lycoming-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 15 grids in Lycoming County came in under 90% of normal in September to October 35 times since 1951, more than any other pair of months. In 2025, August to September ran 53% of normal and May to June ran 163% on the middle of the grids. So far in 2026, June to July sits at 73% and March to April at 142%. Grid 25415 had its driest year in 1980 at 67%.</p>"}
